  "description": "After more than 200 years, the kingdom Chronos is declining. Ten years of peace undermined the army and in the country, formerly called the \"Land of the Sword\", is left with nothing but old heroes. In the south and east, two major kingdoms threaten Chronos. Silonika Isiris in the west is, too, gaining momentum with the smaller states, united under the Radinka Alliance. In addition, King Chronos apparently begins to lose his mind... \n\nIn these challenging times Chronos's only hope lies in their mercenaries, among whom just came a new addition: the young, but incredibly skilled warrior Ares and his friends, Michael and Baron.",
